face-rendered:p001:m0005","quote":"高祖"},{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-022","source_id":"s-liangshu-022-current-rendered-shunzhi-sons-preface","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered:p001","mention_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered:p001:m0014","quote":"高祖"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"南史王氏傳依同書本紀、宗室傳與時序辨識，未採蕭氏遠祖譜接合。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_A","source_assertion_id":"a-liang-close-family-liangwu-father-shunzhi","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-006","source_id":"s-nanshi006-liang-close-family","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-006-liang-close-family","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-006-liang-close-family:p001","quote":"　　梁高祖武皇帝諱衍，字叔達，小字練兒，南蘭陵中都里人，姓蕭氏，與齊同承淮陰令整。整生皇高祖轄，位濟陰太守。轄生皇曾祖副子，位州治中從事。副子生皇祖道賜，位南台治書侍御史。道賜生皇考，諱順之，字文緯，于齊高帝為始族弟。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-006-liang-close-family:p001:m0009","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-006-liang-close-family:p001:m0093","source_term":"皇考"}],"interpretation_note":"明父子來源支援的一代家族路徑；字母為身份配置，不是全體/嫡子出生排行，不由同姓或帝號推祖先。"}},{"id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AAC","label":"武陵王紀","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"武陵王紀","mention_ids":["c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p004:m0009","c-liangshu-055-liang-close-family:p001:m0002"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-zhoushu","book_id":"b-zhoushu-041","source_id":"s-zhoushu041-ws2432538","chapter_id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538","paragraph_id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p004","mention_id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p004:m0009","quote":"武陵王紀"},{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-055","source_id":"s-liangshu055-liang-close-family","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-055-liang-close-family","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-055-liang-close-family:p001","mention_id":"c-liangshu-055-liang-close-family:p001:m0002","quote":"武陵王紀"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"固定WS2432538周書041王襃完整單元的來源局部人物；跨源同指未定不等於必與他篇同名異人。未補遠祖、中間代、未名父母、任期或生卒。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AA","source_assertion_id":"a-liang-close-family-ji-father-liangwu","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-055","source_id":"s-liangshu055-liang-close-family","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-055-liang-close-family","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-055-liang-close-family:p001","quote":"　　武陵王紀字世詢，高祖第八子也。少勤學，有文才，屬辭不好輕華，甚有骨氣。天監十三年，封爲武陵郡王，邑二千戶。歷位寧遠將軍、琅邪彭城二郡太守、輕車將軍、丹陽尹。出爲會稽太守，尋以其郡爲東揚州，仍爲刺史，加使持節、東中郎將。徵爲侍中，領石頭戍軍事。出爲宣惠將軍、江州刺史。徵爲使持節、宣惠將軍、都督揚南徐二州諸軍事、揚州刺史。尋改授持節、都督益梁等十三州諸軍事、安西將軍、益州刺史，加鼓吹一部。大同十一年，授散騎常侍、征西大將軍、開府儀同三司。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-055-liang-close-family:p001:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-055-liang-close-family:p001:m0010","source_term":"高祖第八子"}],"interpretation_note":"明父子來源支援的一代家族路徑；字母為身份配置，不是全體/嫡子出生排行，不由同姓或帝號推祖先。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-liangshu055-liang-close-family","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-055","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-055-liang-close-family","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-liangshu-055-liang-close-family:p001:m0002"],"paragraph_ids":["c-liangshu-055-liang-close-family:p001"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-liangshu-055-liang-close-family:p001:m0002","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-055-liang-close-family:p001:m0002"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"},{"source_id":"s-zhoushu041-ws2432538","work_id":"w-zhoushu","book_id":"b-zhoushu-041","chapter_id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p004:m0009"],"paragraph_ids":[